    "body": "> Of those (A) seems reasonable.\n\nYeah, agreed. Only after I wrote all of my previous comment did I realize that hard-coding the name of the cache dir into the spec source would be a mistake. So let’s definitely not hard-code it.\n\n> But it's kind of a workaround. What about (C), getting the BOILERPLATE inliner tool to accept a custom directory to look for boilerplates in?\n\nYes. Will give it a try that way. Seems totally do-able; it’s right in the `.pre-process-main.pl` script.\n\n(Closing this; thanks for having responded on it quickly and so saving me some time.)\n",
